{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311570","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311570","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1231157001:1":{"text":"브루에게 물어봐야 할 거야. 그가 뭘 쓰고 있는지 전혀 모르겠어.","source_cn":"那你得问布鲁，我也不知道他在写什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86A66173F514A526","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1231157002:1":{"text":"그가 나에게 묻는 건 선원의 매듭법이나 갑판을 닦을 때 쓰는 광택제 같은 세세한 것들이거든.","source_cn":"他总问我非常细节的问题，比如水手结怎么系，甲板用什么抛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEE5ADDD35F43813","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231157003:1":{"text":"그런 게 소설을 쓰는 데 도움이 될까? 난 모르겠어.","source_cn":"这些常识真的能帮他写出好小说来吗？我搞不懂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x488F9A3ED4CE83D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1231157004:1":{"text":"하지만 누군가 동경하는 눈빛으로 바라봐주는 느낌은 나쁘지 않아!","source_cn":"不过，有人一直用憧憬的眼光看着自己，这感觉很不错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC657074A34428849","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水手阿波龙":{"text":"선원 아폴론","source":"水手阿波龙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}